  "title": "Reuben Nachos for Two",
  "description": "Sauerkraut, corned beef, cheese, tortilla chips, and Thousand Island dressing are layered and baked to create these Reuben nachos, a perfect Super Bowl snack!",
  "authors": [
    "Soup Loving Nicole"
